H0201.def:
A man of the Edomites living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 36:11; 
son of: Eliphaz (H0464); 
brother of: Teman (H8487), Zepho (H6825), Gatam (H1609), Kenaz (H7073), Amalek (H6002H) and Korah (H7141H) 
§ Omar = "speaker" or "eloquent"
grandson of Esau

H0208G.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 36:23; 
son of: Shobal (H7732); 
brother of: Alvan (H5935), Manahath (H4506B), Ebal (H5858B) and Shepho (H8195)
§ Onam = "vigorous"
1) a Horite chief, grandson of Seir
2) son Jerahmeel, a chief of Judah

H0208H.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:26; 
son of: Jerahmeel (H3396) and Atarah (H5851); 
brother of: Ram (H7410H), Bunah (H0946), Oren (H0767), Ozem (H0684H) and Ahijah (H0281J); 
father of: Shammai (H8060) and Jada (H3047)
§ Onam = "vigorous"
1) a Horite chief, grandson of Seir
2) son Jerahmeel, a chief of Judah

H0209.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 38:4; 
son of: Judah (H3063) and Bath-shua (H1323I) ; 
brother of: Er (H6147) and Shelah (H7956); 
half-brother of: Perez (H6557) and Zerah (H2226I) 
§ Onan = "strong"
second son of Judah, slain by God for not fulfilling the levitical requirement to beget a child with the wife of a dead, childless brother

H0221G.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Exode 31:2; 
son of: Hur (H2354); 
brother of: Shobal (H7732H), Salma (H8007H), Hareph (H2780), Jezreel (H3157J), Ishma (H3457), Idbash (H3031), Hazzelelponi (H6753), Penuel (H6439H) and Ezer (H5829); 
father of: Bezalel (H1212)
§ Uri = "fiery"
1) a prince of Judah, a son of Hur who was used by God to prepare the tabernacle
2) an officer (or the father of an officer) of Solomon in Gilead
3) a porter or gatekeeper in time of Ezra who took a foreign woman as wife

H0222G.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 6:24; 
son of: Tahath (H8480H); 
father of: Uzziah (H5818H); also called Zephaniah at 1 Chroniques 6:36; 
Also named: tse.phan.yah (צְפַנְיָהוּ "Zephaniah" H6846J)
§ Uriel = "God (El) is my light"
1) chief of the Levitical line of Kohath in David's time
2) maternal grandfather of Abijah

H0223H.def:
A man living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at Esdras 8:33; 
son of: Hakkoz (H6976J); 
father of: Meremoth (H4822)
§ Uriah or Urijah = "Jehovah (Yahweh) is my light (flame)"
a prophet slain by Jehoiakim

H0244A.def:
A man of the tribe of Gad living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:16; 
son of: Gad (H1410); 
brother of: Ziphion (H6837), Haggi (H2291), Shuni (H7764), Eri (H6179), Arod (H0720) and Areli (H0692); also called Ozni at Nombres 26:16; 
Another name of ets.bon (אֶצְבּוֹן "Ezbon" H0675G)
§ Ozni = "my ear (hearing)"
son of Gad

H0244B.def:
Someone descended from Ozni, a man of the tribe of Gad living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:16; 
son of: Gad (H1410); 
brother of: Ziphion (H6837), Haggi (H2291), Shuni (H7764), Eri (H6179), Arod (H0720) and Areli (H0692); also called Ozni at Nombres 26:16; 
Group of ets.bon (אֶצְבּוֹן "Ezbon" H0675)
§ Oznite = "my ear (hearing)"
pertaining to Ozni and his descendants

H0256G.def:
A king of the Kingdom of Israel, living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Rois 16:28; 
son of: Omri (H6018); married to Jezebel (H0348); 
father of: Joash (H3101H), Ahaziah (H0274), Joram (H3141H), Athaliah (H6271)
§ Ahab = "father's brother"
1) king of Israel, son of Omri, husband of Jezebel
2) false prophet executed by Nebuchadrezzar, time of Jeremiah

H0257.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:29; 
son of: Abishur (H0051) and Abihail (H0032H); 
brother of: Molid (H4140) 
§ Ahban = "brother of an understanding (intelligent) one"
son of Abishur of Judah

H0261.def:
A Judge of the tribe of Benjamin living before Israel's Monarchy, first mentioned at Juges 3:15; 
son of: Gera (H1617); 
father of: Naaman (H5283J), Ahijah (H0281K), Gera (H1617J), Uzza (H5798H) and Ahihud (H0284)
Another spelling of e.hud (אֵהוּד "Ehud" H0164) 
§ Ehud = "united"
great grandson of Benjamin

H0265.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at 2 Samuel 23:9; 
son of: Bela (H1106A); 
brother of: Ard (H0714H), Naaman (H5283H), Ezbon (H0675H), Uzzi (H5813I), Uzziel (H5816I), Jerimoth (H3406), Iri (H5901), Addar (H0146H), Gera (H1617I), Abihud (H0031) and Abishua (H0050H); also called Ahoah at 1 Chroniques 8:4; 
Also named: a.cho.chi (אֲחוֹחִי "Ahohite" H0266) 
§ Ahoah = "brother of rest"
a grandson of Benjamin

H0266.def:
Someone descended from Ahoah, a man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at 2 Samuel 23:9; 
son of: Bela (H1106A); 
brother of: Ard (H0714H), Naaman (H5283H), Ezbon (H0675H), Uzzi (H5813I), Uzziel (H5816I), Jerimoth (H3406), Iri (H5901), Addar (H0146H), Gera (H1617I), Abihud (H0031) and Abishua (H0050H); also called Ahoah at 1 Chroniques 8:4; 
Group of a.cho.ach (אֲחוֹחַ "Ahoah" H0265) 
§ Ahohite = "brother of rest"
one of the clan of Ahoah

H0267.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:2; 
son of: Jahath (H3189); 
brother of: Lahad (H3855) 
§ Ahumai = "a water reed: brother of waters"
grandson of Shobal, descendant of Judah

H0271H.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:35; 
son of: Micah (H4318H); 
brother of: Pithon (H6377), Melech (H4429) and Tarea (H8390); 
father of: Jehoaddah (H3085)
§ Ahaz = "he has grasped"
1) king of Judah, son Jotham, father of Hezekiah
2) a Benjamite, son of Micah, and great grandson of Jonathan

H0273.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 9:12; 
son of: Meshillemith (H4921); 
father of: Jahzerah (H3170); also called Ahzai (KJV: Ahasai) at Néhémie 11:13;
Another name of me.shul.lam (מְשֻׁלָּם "Meshullam" H4918M) 
§ Ahasai = "my holder, protector"
a post-exilic priest, in Jerusalem

H0274G.def:
A king of the Kingdom of Israel, living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Rois 22:40; 
son of: Ahab (H0256) and Jezebel (H0348); 
brother of: Joash (H3101H), Joram (H3141H) and Athaliah (H6271)
§ Ahaziah = "Jehovah (Yahu) holds (possesses)"
1) ruler of Israel, son of Ahab
2) ruler of Judah, son of Jehoram (Joram)

H0274H.def:
A king of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Rois 8:24; 
son of: Jehoram (H3088) and Athaliah (H6271); 
brother of: Jehosheba (H3089); married to Zibiah (H6645); 
father of: Joash (H3101I); also called Jehoahaz at 2 Chroniques 21:17; 
§ Ahaziah = "Jehovah (Yahu) holds (possesses)"
1) ruler of Israel, son of Ahab
2) ruler of Judah, son of Jehoram (Joram)

H0275.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:6; 
son of: Ashhur (H0806) and Naarah (H5292B); 
brother of: Hepher (H2660), Temeni (H8488) and Haahashtari (H0326); 
half-brother of: Zereth (H6889), Izhar (H3328), Ethnan (H0869) and Koz (H6976) 
§ Ahuzam = "possessor"
a descendant of Judah through Caleb

H0277H.def:
A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:34; 
son of: Shomer (H7763H); 
brother of: Rohgah (H7303), Jehubbah (H3160) and Aram (H0758J); also translated "brother"; 
§ Ahi = "my brother"
1) a head of the families of Gad
2) an Asherite

H0278.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:21; 
son of: Benjamin (H1144); 
brother of: Bela (H1106A), Becher (H1071), Ashbel (H0788), Gera (H1617), Naaman (H5283), Rosh (H7220), Muppim (H4649), Huppim (H2650H), Ard (H0714), Ahiram (H0297) and Jediael (H3043); also called Aharah at 1 Chroniques 8:1; 
Also named: ach.rach (אַחְרַח "Aharah" H0315) 
§ Ehi = "my brother"
son of Benjamin

H0284.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living before Israel's Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:7; 
son of: Ehud (H0164); 
brother of: Naaman (H5283J), Ahijah (H0281K), Gera (H1617J) and Uzza (H5798H) 
§ Ahihud = "brother of mystery"
a Benjamite, son of Ehud

H0285G.def:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Samuel 14:3; 
son of: Phinehas (H6372H); 
brother of: Ichabod (H0350); 
father of: Ahimelech (H0288)
§ Ahitub = "my brother is good (goodness)"
1) a grandson of Eli
2) the father of Zadok the priest

H0285H.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Samuel 8:17; 
son of: Amariah (H0568); 
father of: Zadok (H6659)
§ Ahitub = "my brother is good (goodness)"
1) a grandson of Eli
2) the father of Zadok the priest

H0285I.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 6:11; 
son of: Amariah (H0568H); 
father of: Zadok (H6659I)
§ Ahitub = "my brother is good (goodness)"
1) a grandson of Eli
2) the father of Zadok the priest

H0287.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 6:25; 
son of: Amasai (H6022); 
father of: Elkanah (H0511J); also called Mahath at 1 Chroniques 6:35; 
Also named: ma.chat (מַ֫חַת "Mahath" H4287I) 
§ Ahimoth = "brother of death" or "my brother is death"
a son of Elkanah, a Levite

H0288G.def:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Samuel 14:3; 
son of: Ahitub (H0285); 
father of: Abiathar (H0054); also called Ahijah (KJV: Ahiah) at 1 Samuel 14:3,18;
Also named: a.chiy.yah (אֲחִיָּ֫הוּ "Ahijah" H0281O)
§ Ahimelech = "my brother is king" or "brother of Melek"
1) a priest murdered by Doeg at Saul's command, for supposedly assisting David
2) a Hittite warrior under David

H0289G.def:
A man living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Nombres 13:22; 
son of: Anak (H6061); 
brother of: Sheshai (H8344) and Talmai (H8526)
§ Ahiman = "my brother is a gift"
1) a son of Anak
2) a Levite servant in the temple

H0291.def:
A man of the tribe of Manasseh living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:19; 
son of: Shemida (H8061); 
brother of: Shechem (H7928H), Likhi (H3949) and Aniam (H0593) 
§ Ahian = "brotherly" or "fraternal"
son of Shemida of Manasseh

H0293G.def:
A woman living at the time of United Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Samuel 14:50; 
daughter of: Ahimaaz (H0290); married to Saul (H7586G); 
mother of: Jonathan (H3083H), Abinadab (H0041H), Malchi-shua (H4444), Merab (H4764) and Michal (H4324)
§ Ahinoam = "my brother is delight"
1) wife of Saul, daughter of Ahimaaz
2) wife of David, mother of Amnon, a Jezreelitess

H0295H.def:
A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 12:3; 
son of: Shemaah (H8094); 
brother of: Joash (H3101L)
§ Ahiezer = "my brother is help"
1) a Danite chief who assisted Moses
2) a Danite chief, one of David's heroes

H0296.def:
A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Rois 22:12; 
son of: Shaphan (H8227B); 
brother of: Elasah (H0501J) and Gemariah (H1587H); 
father of: Gedaliah (H1436B) 
§ Ahikam = "my brother has risen (arisen)"
1) son of Shaphan, an officer in Josiah's reign
2) protector of Jeremiah
3) father of Gedaliah

H0297.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at Nombres 26:38; 
son of: Benjamin (H1144); 
brother of: Bela (H1106A), Becher (H1071), Ashbel (H0788), Gera (H1617), Naaman (H5283), Ehi (H0278), Rosh (H7220), Muppim (H4649), Huppim (H2650H), Ard (H0714) and Jediael (H3043)
Also named: a.chi.ra.mi (אֲחִירָמִי "Ahiramite" H0298) 
§ Ahiram = "my brother is exalted" or "brother or (the) lofty"
a Benjamite, son of Benjamin

H0298.def:
Someone descended from Ahiram, a man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at Nombres 26:38; 
son of: Benjamin (H1144); 
brother of: Bela (H1106A), Becher (H1071), Ashbel (H0788), Gera (H1617), Naaman (H5283), Ehi (H0278), Rosh (H7220), Muppim (H4649), Huppim (H2650H), Ard (H0714) and Jediael (H3043)
Group of a.chi.ram (אֲחִירָם "Ahiram" H0297) 
§ Ahiramite = "brother of mother"
one of the clan of Ahiram
